00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,320
Did you see it?

848
00:29:54,080 --> 00:29:54,680
Wen.

849
00:30:02,760 --> 00:30:03,480
Wen.

850
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:04,240
Break free from him.

851
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:06,360
What about you?

852
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:08,920
Let me get dressed first,

853
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,040
and then I'll help you.

854
00:30:13,320 --> 00:30:13,760
Xingxu.

855
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:15,200
Do you think she will?

856
00:30:15,640 --> 00:30:16,600
Xingxu, think about it.

857
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:17,640
Just now,

858
00:30:18,080 --> 00:30:19,040
for what you did to me,

859
00:30:19,040 --> 00:30:20,040
I don't blame you.

860
00:30:22,040 --> 00:30:23,280
Was I helping you

861
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:24,480
throw Yuwen off?

862
00:30:25,040 --> 00:30:25,400
Yes.

863
00:30:26,360 --> 00:30:27,440
You know what to do, right?

864
00:30:29,120 --> 00:30:31,040
Xingxu, hear out my game plan.

865
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:32,160
Once I button up,

866
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:34,440
I'll bring your shirt over for you.

867
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,760
Keep Nai held off.

868
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:36,400
Once you're dressed,

869
00:30:36,400 --> 00:30:37,840
we'll go in together.

870
00:30:37,840 --> 00:30:39,200
This is pretty risky.

871
00:30:39,200 --> 00:30:40,360
Because when you're getting his shirt,

872
00:30:40,360 --> 00:30:41,400
the lights might turn on

873
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:42,400
and you'll be moving around.

874
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,480
Then you'll have to take your shirt off.

875
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:44,720
So I suggest you

876
00:30:44,720 --> 00:30:45,080
get in first.

877
00:30:50,840 --> 00:30:52,261
This is pretty risky.

878
00:30:56,600 --> 00:30:57,400
(Lights out)
Xingxu.

879
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:57,960
Get in quickly.

880
00:31:06,070 --> 00:31:06,760
(Without hesitation)
Get in quickly.

881
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:24,480
So touching.

882
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:25,840
You pounced perfectly.

883
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:27,400
Right?

884
00:31:28,840 --> 00:31:29,560
Where is she?

885
00:31:29,560 --> 00:31:29,920
Where?

886
00:31:30,095 --> 00:31:32,030
(Lights out)

887
00:31:37,448 --> 00:31:38,228
(Lights out)

888
00:31:42,000 --> 00:31:43,240
How did she spot me?

889
00:31:44,021 --> 00:31:45,200
(Protecting)

890
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:46,600
In the martial world, there's a skill

891
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:47,760
called "locating by sound".

892
00:31:49,226 --> 00:31:53,640
(Night vision mode)

893
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,520
Are you still buttoning up, Nai?

894
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:55,760
Nai, are you still buttoning up?

895
00:31:59,315 --> 00:32:00,522
(Only one button left)

896
00:32:03,360 --> 00:32:03,920
Move out of the way.

897
00:32:04,477 --> 00:32:05,520
(Lights out)
I don't want to hurt you, kid.

898
00:32:07,672 --> 00:32:09,190
(How did he get in?)

899
00:32:09,403 --> 00:32:11,028
(I completed the mission)

900
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:14,880
You didn't button it up.

901
00:32:14,880 --> 00:32:15,520
You buttoned it wrong.

902
00:32:15,520 --> 00:32:16,240
You didn't button it up.

903
00:32:16,297 --> 00:32:18,456
(Buttons all misaligned)

904
00:32:18,560 --> 00:32:20,280
You got all the buttons wrong.

905
00:32:20,280 --> 00:32:21,840
I don't know how to button.

906
00:32:22,624 --> 00:32:24,227
(Only one button left)

907
00:32:27,754 --> 00:32:28,720
He got all the buttons right.

908
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:31,720
The thing is, you need to unbutton
all of them first.

909
00:32:32,440 --> 00:32:33,440
All wrong.

910
00:32:35,577 --> 00:32:36,486
(Lights out)

911
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:39,960
Why is it you again?

912
00:32:40,333 --> 00:32:40,920
(Why is it always you?)

913
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:42,120
Who else could it be?

914
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:43,760
Hold out a while.

915
00:32:43,760 --> 00:32:44,920
Xingxu will get all buttons done.

916
00:32:45,400 --> 00:32:46,160
Just one left.

917
00:32:47,360 --> 00:32:48,560
(Lights out)
Nai.

918
00:32:50,920 --> 00:32:51,640
(Locked them tight)
Such core strength.

919
00:32:53,760 --> 00:32:54,760
Li Naiwen.

920
00:32:54,760 --> 00:32:56,440
From behind, you look like a giant baby.

921
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:57,134
(Never Give Up)

922
00:32:57,412 --> 00:32:58,240
(Lights out)

923
00:32:58,240 --> 00:32:59,560
Nai, there's no need for that.

924
00:33:01,200 --> 00:33:02,280
Aren't we doing fine like this?

925
00:33:05,920 --> 00:33:07,280
Let's just take him in with us.

926
00:33:07,280 --> 00:33:08,520
Right.

927
00:33:10,312 --> 00:33:15,987
(Night vision mode)

928
00:33:16,094 --> 00:33:17,601
(Wang Yuwen and Chen Xingxu
completed the mission)

929
00:33:19,727 --> 00:33:22,087
♪Turns out that meeting you♪

930
00:33:22,087 --> 00:33:24,719
♪Is the joy hidden in the world♪

931
00:33:24,719 --> 00:33:27,262
♪We still have to experience together♪

932
00:33:27,262 --> 00:33:29,965
♪Exploring the novelty of the world♪

933
00:33:29,965 --> 00:33:32,424
♪This is our wonderful encounter♪

934
00:33:32,424 --> 00:33:34,935
♪I find good scenery
for you along the way♪

935
00:33:34,935 --> 00:33:37,030
♪You are the joy hidden in the world♪

936
00:33:37,030 --> 00:33:40,610
♪I'm lucky to have met you♪

937
00:34:00,329 --> 00:34:01,953
♪That day,
we traveled together far away♪

938
00:34:02,263 --> 00:34:05,608
♪In countless late nights,
we exchanged courage♪

939
00:34:05,608 --> 00:34:07,137
♪Our fates have already intertwined♪

940
00:34:07,137 --> 00:34:09,189
♪In each other's life trajectories♪

941
00:34:09,189 --> 00:34:12,801
♪We leave behind
bonds like no other for a lifetime♪

942
00:34:14,030 --> 00:34:16,627
♪Turns out that meeting you♪

943
00:34:16,627 --> 00:34:19,064
♪Is the joy hidden in the world♪

944
00:34:19,182 --> 00:34:21,800
♪We still have to experience together♪

945
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:24,472
♪Exploring the novelty of the world♪

946
00:34:24,472 --> 00:34:26,866
♪This is our wonderful encounter♪

947
00:34:26,866 --> 00:34:29,420
♪I find good scenery
for you along the way♪

948
00:34:29,420 --> 00:34:31,483
♪You are the joy hidden in the world♪

949
00:34:31,483 --> 00:34:33,895
♪I'm lucky to have met you♪

950
00:34:35,662 --> 00:34:37,649
♪Traveling around the earth♪

951
00:34:38,248 --> 00:34:40,214
♪Tasting all the freshness♪

952
00:34:40,214 --> 00:34:42,224
♪Having traveled all corners♪

953
00:34:42,224 --> 00:34:45,319
♪We still stand shoulder to shoulder♪

954
00:34:46,167 --> 00:34:47,974
♪I'm glad to have met you♪

955
00:34:48,743 --> 00:34:50,389
♪We sing beautifully together♪

956
00:34:50,389 --> 00:34:51,618
♪Even if we're scattered in the future♪

957
00:34:51,618 --> 00:34:57,539
♪Thankfully we still share the same sky♪
